    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029090/extras/e577b7293ede854c7216fc6d153d5e65.poster.avif?t=1755096390\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029090/extras/e577b7293ede854c7216fc6d153d5e65.webm?t=1755096390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029090/extras/e577b7293ede854c7216fc6d153d5e65.mp4?t=1755096390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong>Rush N Crash</strong> is an exciting kart racing game where humans and zombies battle it out in intense competitions. With both single-player and upcoming multiplayer modes, players experience a unique blend of skills, strategy, and adrenaline-pumping action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single &amp; Multiplayer Modes (Coming Soon):</strong> Sharpen your skills in a story-driven single-player campaign, or challenge opponents in online multiplayer races once it's available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced, Competitive Gameplay:</strong> Boost your speed, outmaneuver rivals, or use defensive tactics to dominate on dynamic and unpredictable tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong> Survive within a time limit in high-stakes races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Savior Mode:</strong> Complete rescue missions while staying alive against all odds.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Selection &amp; Customization (Coming Soon):</strong> Choose between human and zombie factions, express your style with unique skins, and join the race in your own way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Power-Ups:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available Now:</strong> Use concept-based abilities to gain an edge against zombie threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Soon:</strong> Surprise your opponents with rockets, barriers, and phasing power-ups.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Visuals &amp; Dynamic Soundtrack:</strong> Cartoon-style graphics and immersive music bring the racing chaos to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: All features related to online/multiplayer modes are planned for future updates. Timelines will be announced to players accordingly.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029090/extras/e577b7293ede854c7216fc6d153d5e65.poster.avif?t=1755096390\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029090/extras/e577b7293ede854c7216fc6d153d5e65.webm?t=1755096390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029090/extras/e577b7293ede854c7216fc6d153d5e65.mp4?t=1755096390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong>Rush N Crash</strong> is an exciting kart racing game where humans and zombies battle it out in intense competitions. With both single-player and upcoming multiplayer modes, players experience a unique blend of skills, strategy, and adrenaline-pumping action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single &amp; Multiplayer Modes (Coming Soon):</strong> Sharpen your skills in a story-driven single-player campaign, or challenge opponents in online multiplayer races once it's available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced, Competitive Gameplay:</strong> Boost your speed, outmaneuver rivals, or use defensive tactics to dominate on dynamic and unpredictable tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong> Survive within a time limit in high-stakes races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Savior Mode:</strong> Complete rescue missions while staying alive against all odds.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Selection &amp; Customization (Coming Soon):</strong> Choose between human and zombie factions, express your style with unique skins, and join the race in your own way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Power-Ups:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available Now:</strong> Use concept-based abilities to gain an edge against zombie threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Soon:</strong> Surprise your opponents with rockets, barriers, and phasing power-ups.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Visuals &amp; Dynamic Soundtrack:</strong> Cartoon-style graphics and immersive music bring the racing chaos to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: All features related to online/multiplayer modes are planned for future updates. Timelines will be announced to players accordingly.</i></p>",
